1
00:00:01,060 --> 00:00:02,560
上帝保佑 菩萨保佑 佛祖保佑
Please, please, please, please.

2
00:00:02,580 --> 00:00:03,500
你们在干嘛啊
Okay, what is this?

3
00:00:03,677 --> 00:00:04,817
在确认我身高已经足够
We're making sure I'm tall enough

4
00:00:04,920 --> 00:00:06,280
可以乘坐迪斯尼乐园所有设施
to ride all the rides at Disneyland.

5
00:00:06,280 --> 00:00:07,780
不用把头发竖成钉耙冒充高个儿
Without having to spike up my hair.

6
00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:08,200
老弟
Buddy...

7
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:10,180
完全合格
We are good to go.

8
00:00:10,460 --> 00:00:10,900
帅呆了
Sweet!

9
00:00:11,260 --> 00:00:12,460
我期待这一天已经很久了
I have been waiting for this day

10
00:00:12,460 --> 00:00:13,600
自从医生指着你妈的
ever since the doctor pointed

11
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:16,260
子宫超声波图对我说
to the ultrasound of your mom's womb and said,

12
00:00:16,318 --> 00:00:17,378
"那货如果不是有五肢
"Either that's a fifth limb,

13
00:00:17,378 --> 00:00:18,529
那么你就要抱儿子了"
or you got a boy."

14
00:00:18,529 --> 00:00:19,339
别说了 真恶心
Okay, no. Gross.

15
00:00:19,380 --> 00:00:22,200
听好 大家今天都在家把饭吃饱了
All right... I want everybody to eat a lot at home

16
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:24,180
因为世上最销魂的极乐之地
because "The happiest place on earth"

17
00:00:24,180 --> 00:00:26,480
卖的西班牙油条也贵得离谱
is also home to the most expensive churro on earth.

18
00:00:26,480 --> 00:00:28,440
拜托 一定会爽翻天的
Come on. This is gonna be awesome.

19
00:00:28,440 --> 00:00:30,380
谁不爱迪斯尼一日游呢
Who doesn't love a day at Disneyland?

20
00:00:30,750 --> 00:00:32,390
你们就不能放过我吗
Can't you and mom go without me?

21
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:34,100
你是小孩 小孩就应该去
You're the kid. I think we need you to get in.

22
00:00:34,411 --> 00:00:36,331
非得挑今天这么个日子
Well, it couldn't come on a worst day.

23
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:38,140
科技板块正在大跳水呢
The technology sector is tanking.

24
00:00:38,461 --> 00:00:40,231
学校布置了一个股票市场模拟的作业
We're doing a stock market project in school,

25
00:00:40,231 --> 00:00:41,802
今天是最后一天了
and today's the last day.

26
00:00:41,802 --> 00:00:44,132
我们每人有一千元代币用来投资
We all get a thousand fake dollars to invest,

27
00:00:44,140 --> 00:00:45,660
到昨天闭市为止
and as the market closed yesterday,

28
00:00:45,660 --> 00:00:46,700
我独占鳌头
I'm in the lead.

29
00:00:47,400 --> 00:00:49,780
小哥我身高不突出 运动不拔尖
I may not be the tallest or the most athletic,

30
00:00:50,020 --> 00:00:51,540
但有朝一日我绝对是大款
but someday I will be the richest,

31
00:00:51,960 --> 00:00:54,240
妹子们都爱傍大款
which is good because the ladies love that,

32
00:00:54,300 --> 00:00:56,420
鉴于我爹妈的配对情况 我已经习惯了
and I've grown accustomed to a certain lifestyle.

33
00:00:57,534 --> 00:01:00,074
你真会喜欢那些看重你钱的姑娘吗
Do you really wants girls who only want you for your money?

34
00:01:00,320 --> 00:01:01,440
我希望自己有那个选择权
I'd like to have that option.

35
00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:05,300
曼尼 别管股市了 把米老鼠耳朵戴上
Manny, put the stock away and put your ears on.

36
00:01:05,620 --> 00:01:07,480
妈 我不用戴这个吧
Mom, I don't think you have to wear one of these.

37
00:01:07,580 --> 00:01:09,460
像个小孩样 给娘戴上
Be a kid! Put them on!

38
00:01:09,680 --> 00:01:11,500
没搞错吧 穿这双鞋
Really? Those shoes?

39
00:01:12,340 --> 00:01:12,720
怎么了
What?

40
00:01:12,900 --> 00:01:15,020
你知道在迪斯尼乐园得走多少路吗
Do you know how much walking you have to do at Disneyland?

41
00:01:15,780 --> 00:01:18,080
没瞅见那群懒胖子都用滑板车来代步吗
Why do you think they have so many fat people on scooters?

42
00:01:18,306 --> 00:01:20,237
我就喜欢高跟鞋 我没事
I like wearing the high heels. I'm fine.

43
00:01:20,237 --> 00:01:22,417
就跟上次我让你带件外套
It's just like that jacket you refuse to bring

44
00:01:22,417 --> 00:01:24,327
而你宁死不听的情况一样
when I say, "Take a jacket."

45
00:01:24,407 --> 00:01:26,007
"别老对我紫手画脚 我没事"
"Don't tell me what to do! I'm fine!"

46
00:01:26,007 --> 00:01:27,358
结果呢 你才不是没事
Huh? And you're not fine.

47
00:01:27,700 --> 00:01:28,780
你又冷又冻
You're cold and shivering,

48
00:01:28,900 --> 00:01:31,080
我则像个连外套都不肯脱给老婆的混球一样
and I look like the jerk who won't give his wife a jacket,

49
00:01:31,340 --> 00:01:33,340
于是只好把外套给你 结果自己受冷受冻
so I do, and then I'm cold and shivering,

50
00:01:33,460 --> 00:01:34,620
可明明我自己就带了外套的
and I brought a jacket.

51
00:01:34,900 --> 00:01:37,540
你那叨逼叨的外套故事完了没
Are you done with your boring jacket story?

52
00:01:37,700 --> 00:01:38,920
再继续说就要赶上大塞车了
Because we're going to hit traffic.

53
00:01:39,709 --> 00:01:42,279
我就一句话 到时候可别想穿我的鞋
Tell you one thing. I'm not gonna give you my shoes.

54
00:01:43,820 --> 00:01:45,460
哈 一定是伊森到了
Ah! That must be Ethan.

55
00:01:45,720 --> 00:01:46,400
伊森是谁啊
Who's Ethan?

56
00:01:46,770 --> 00:01:47,780
我没告诉你们吗
Didn't I tell you?

57
00:01:47,780 --> 00:01:50,581
我朋友贝瑟妮的侄子今天和我们一起去
My friend Bethenny's nephew is coming with us today.

58
00:01:50,581 --> 00:01:52,061
他为了上大学方便搬家至此
He moved to town to go to college.

59
00:01:52,180 --> 00:01:55,160
他人超和善 超聪明 还会玩冰球
He's very nice, very smart, big hockey player.

60
00:01:55,160 --> 00:01:56,240
我看穿你在耍什么花样了
I know what you're doing.

61
00:01:56,720 --> 00:01:57,920
真的吗 她说得这么"隐晦"
Really? She was so subtle.

62
00:01:58,380 --> 00:01:59,820
海莉总是喜欢坏男生
Haley has a thing for bad boys,

63
00:01:59,820 --> 00:02:01,500
真是有其母必有其女
which was so me.

64
00:02:02,060 --> 00:02:02,440
显然嘛
Clearly.

65
00:02:04,060 --> 00:02:06,480
如果她即将离巢而去
So if she's going to be leaving the nest soon,

66
00:02:06,480 --> 00:02:08,280
也最好不要是骑在摩托后座走的
we'd prefer it was not on the back of a motorcycle.

67
00:02:08,560 --> 00:02:10,280
我大学室友就有辆摩托
My college roommate had a motorcycle.

68
00:02:11,280 --> 00:02:13,660
我当年在车后座度过了很多幸福的时光
Man, I had some good times on the back of that thing.

69
00:02:15,480 --> 00:02:16,720
真不敢相信你会这么做
I can't believe you did this.

70
00:02:16,724 --> 00:02:19,134
我可不要照顾贝瑟妮的侄儿 交给艾丽克斯了
I'm not gonna babysit Bethenny's nephew. Alex can have him.

71
00:02:19,180 --> 00:02:20,740
被你拒绝的次品我可不稀罕
Okay, I don't need your rejects.

72
00:02:21,195 --> 00:02:23,875
伊森 真高兴你能来
Hi, Ethan! I'm so glad you could make it.

73
00:02:23,875 --> 00:02:24,595
谢谢您邀请我
Thanks for inviting me.

74
00:02:24,595 --> 00:02:25,415
没事
Sure.

75
00:02:25,415 --> 00:02:26,835
你好 我叫艾
Hi. I'm Al--

76
00:02:27,200 --> 00:02:29,620
她是我14岁的小妹 伊森 对吧
my 14-year-old sister. Ethan, was it?

77
00:02:29,680 --> 00:02:30,020
没错
Yeah.

78
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:46,940
那是我外公和他老婆歌洛莉亚
And that's my grandpa and his wife Gloria

79
00:02:46,960 --> 00:02:48,260
还有她儿子曼尼
and her son Manny.

80
00:02:48,480 --> 00:02:50,140
你们真是个大家庭啊
Wow. You guys have a big family.

81
00:02:50,880 --> 00:02:51,820
大家庭呢
Big family.

82
00:02:53,440 --> 00:02:54,600
她挺中意他的
She likes him!

83
00:02:54,720 --> 00:02:55,340
谁能不中意啊
Yeah, who wouldn't?

84
00:02:55,460 --> 00:02:56,980
哪找来的 汤米·席尔菲格成衣目录吗
Where'd you find him, a Tommy Hilfiger catalog?

85
00:02:57,929 --> 00:03:00,080
他高考考了2200分
He got a 2200 on his S.A.T.S.

86
00:03:00,080 --> 00:03:01,460
那双摄魂美眸
And those eyes...

87
00:03:01,460 --> 00:03:03,200
你是在挑女婿还是在找老公啊
Okay, did you get him for Haley or for you?

88
00:03:03,360 --> 00:03:03,760
米奇尔
Mitchell.

89
00:03:04,780 --> 00:03:07,320
自从小时候跟爸一起来之后 我就再也没来过了
You know, I haven't been here since dad brought us when we were kids.

90
00:03:07,331 --> 00:03:11,181
对 记得吗 你还为那亚伯拉罕·林肯哭了
Ohh, yeah. Remember? You cried in the Abraham Lincoln thing.

91
00:03:11,181 --> 00:03:12,491
人家是伟大的总统
Hey, he's a great president,

92
00:03:12,491 --> 00:03:14,682
况且我也是头一回看见机器人
and it was the first robot I ever saw.

93
00:03:15,152 --> 00:03:16,622
克莱尔和米奇尔小时候
When Claire and Mitchell were young,

94
00:03:16,622 --> 00:03:19,172
我和他们妈妈准备带他们去迪斯尼乐园玩
their mom and I were gonna take them to Disneyland.

95
00:03:19,192 --> 00:03:21,382
那天早上 迪迪和我大吵一架
But that morning, Dede and I got in this huge fight

96
00:03:21,382 --> 00:03:24,073
就为了些鸡毛蒜皮的小事
over something or other-- surprise, surprise--

97
00:03:24,073 --> 00:03:26,193
最后我只好独自带他们去
and I ended up taking them on my own.

98
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:29,060
克莱尔的噩梦是撞见那邪恶皇后
Claire's biggest fear was running into the evil queen.

99
00:03:29,780 --> 00:03:32,300
我的噩梦是已经娶回家一个邪恶皇后
My biggest fear was that I married her.

100
00:03:32,940 --> 00:03:35,360
身高超过1米17的同志们
Okay, people over 46 inches,

101
00:03:35,520 --> 00:03:37,080
第一站 印第安纳琼斯
first stop--Indiana Jones!

102
00:03:37,545 --> 00:03:39,105
莉莉 你就在茶杯转盘里好好玩吧
Have fun on the teacups, Lily.

103
00:03:39,105 --> 00:03:40,125
大家出发吧
Okay, let's do this.

104
00:03:40,125 --> 00:03:42,835
各位 先等一下
Oh, okay, wait just a second here, everybody.

105
00:03:43,480 --> 00:03:44,480
好了
All right.

106
00:03:45,960 --> 00:03:47,180
你那是根遛狗绳吗
Is that a leash?

107
00:03:47,180 --> 00:03:49,880
不 是孩童安全系绳 走这边 乖女儿
No, it's a child safety tether. This way, sweetie.

108
00:03:51,086 --> 00:03:52,197
那就是根遛狗绳
It--it's a leash.

109
00:03:52,246 --> 00:03:53,677
别对我们评判指责
Don't--don't judge us.

110
00:03:53,880 --> 00:03:54,420
来吧
Go on.

111
00:03:55,580 --> 00:03:56,340
我们家有个乱窜鬼
We have a runner.

112
00:03:56,797 --> 00:03:58,137
莉莉正处于某种阶段
Lily is going through a phase--

113
00:03:58,137 --> 00:03:59,567
至少 我们希望这只是阶段现象
at least... Oh, we hope it's a phase.

114
00:03:59,680 --> 00:04:01,240
她一逮到机会就往外窜
She bolts every chance she gets.

115
00:04:01,848 --> 00:04:02,999
莉莉
Lily!

116
00:04:03,488 --> 00:04:04,529
莉莉
Lily!

117
00:04:04,918 --> 00:04:05,728
莉莉
Lily!

118
00:04:05,728 --> 00:04:06,908
我们别无选择
So we had no choice

119
00:04:07,160 --> 00:04:08,780
只能给她系上儿童安全系绳
to put her on a child safety tether.

120
00:04:09,100 --> 00:04:09,960
就是根遛狗绳
It's a leash.

121
00:04:10,900 --> 00:04:12,780
我们当然可以选择不系
And we did have a choice.

122
00:04:14,779 --> 00:04:16,310
莉莉 宝贝 别拉绳子
Lily, sweetie, don't pull.

123
00:04:16,890 --> 00:04:17,660
莉莉 跟紧
Lily, heel!

124
00:04:17,660 --> 00:04:18,910
爸爸
Dad.

125
00:04:18,950 --> 00:04:20,520
早知道你们会玩这个把戏
If I'd had known you guys were gonna do this,

126
00:04:20,680 --> 00:04:21,300
我就把斯黛拉也牵来了
I'd have brought Stella.

127
00:04:21,640 --> 00:04:22,440
都是小卡的主意
It was Cam's idea.

128
00:04:22,520 --> 00:04:23,380
"多谢"你和我站在同一战线上
So much for the united front.

129
00:04:23,491 --> 00:04:26,441
告诉你 你尽管笑吧 莉莉自己享受就好
I'll have you know, despite all your jokes, Lily enjoys it.

130
00:04:26,820 --> 00:04:28,900
宝贝 别学狗叫 你就别添乱了
Okay, sweetie, you're not helping. You're not helping.

131
00:04:29,160 --> 00:04:30,940
我的天 你们快看 那不是迪兰吗
Oh, my God. Oh, my God. You guys, is that Dylan?

132
00:04:31,120 --> 00:04:31,520
什么
What?

133
00:04:31,642 --> 00:04:32,612
老天
Oh, jeez.

134
00:04:32,612 --> 00:04:33,251
迪兰
Dylan?!

135
00:04:33,251 --> 00:04:38,503
你在干嘛 我都不知道你回城了
Uh, what are you... I didn't even know you were in town.

136
00:04:38,503 --> 00:04:39,714
我也不知道
Either did I...

137
00:04:40,123 --> 00:04:41,323
不知道你在城里
Know you were in town.

138
00:04:41,323 --> 00:04:43,283
我是说迪斯尼小城 阿纳海姆
This town. Anaheim.

139
00:04:43,283 --> 00:04:44,863
我以为你还在怀俄明州呢
I thought you were still in Wyoming.

140
00:04:44,863 --> 00:04:47,154
我的确是
I was, uh...

141
00:04:47,154 --> 00:04:48,375
不过
But, um...

142
00:04:48,580 --> 00:04:49,240
糟了
Oh, shoot.

143
00:04:49,264 --> 00:04:51,174
我还得和几个朋友碰面
You know, I, uh, gotta meet up with some friends

144
00:04:51,174 --> 00:04:53,194
我已经迟到了
and I'm... really late.

145
00:04:53,720 --> 00:04:55,240
很高兴见到你 海莉
It was nice to see you, Haley,

146
00:04:55,500 --> 00:04:56,480
还有大家
and everybody.

147
00:04:58,140 --> 00:04:59,160
还有我不认识的这位
And dude I don't know.

148
00:04:59,460 --> 00:05:01,040
我叫伊森 很高兴见到你
I'm Ethan. It's nice to meet you.

149
00:05:01,240 --> 00:05:02,620
彬彬有礼 可惜我还是不认识
And polite dude I don't know.

150
00:05:07,386 --> 00:05:09,147
海莉以前和那人交往过吗
Did Haley used to date that guy or something?

151
00:05:09,147 --> 00:05:12,417
没错 你要是和她交往 就和他是同等级的货色了
Yep. You date her, that's the club you're joining. Mm.

152
00:05:12,560 --> 00:05:14,800
他真是风采不减当年
Of course he would still look amazing.

153
00:05:15,220 --> 00:05:16,400
有吗 我怎么没觉得
Does he? I hadn't noticed.

154
00:05:17,220 --> 00:05:20,020
伊森会吹小号你知道吗
Did you know that Ethan plays the trumpet?

155
00:05:20,400 --> 00:05:22,760
难怪有那么性感的嘴唇 是吧
No great surprise with those lips of his, huh?

156
00:05:22,918 --> 00:05:25,049
一切进展顺利啊 鲁宾逊太太
Coo-coo-ca-choo, Mrs. Robinson.

157
00:05:25,980 --> 00:05:27,620
好了伙计 测量真相的时刻了
Okay, buddy, moment of truth.

158
00:05:30,120 --> 00:05:30,680
好哎
Yes!

159
00:05:31,850 --> 00:05:35,240
可要玩到爽翻天啊
This is gonna be so awesome! Yeah!

160
00:05:38,220 --> 00:05:41,660
再等45分钟 玩到爽翻天啊
In 45 minutes, this is gonna be so awesome!

161
00:05:46,691 --> 00:05:47,442
听着罗本
Look, Reuben,

162
00:05:47,500 --> 00:05:49,220
我手头有不少垃圾股要抛
I have some underperformers I have to unload,

163
00:05:49,360 --> 00:05:50,900
可现在周围没电脑可以连上网
and I don't have access to a computer.

164
00:05:51,422 --> 00:05:53,192
用"钱爷·迪尔加多"的名字登录
Log in as moneydelgado--

165
00:05:53,192 --> 00:05:54,153
曼尼
Manny!

166
00:05:54,272 --> 00:05:55,073
快想办法去 罗本
By all means, Reuben,

167
00:05:55,120 --> 00:05:56,780
"日经指数"闭市了再去吃冰棒好吗
go get a popsicle while the nikkei closes.

168
00:05:56,933 --> 00:05:58,314
别让我变成穷鬼
I wanna be a pauper.

169
00:05:58,860 --> 00:06:00,500
妈 我那支股票突然暴跌
Mom, my stocks just took a dive.

170
00:06:00,620 --> 00:06:02,360
你再说我把你手机跌水里去
Your phone is about to take a dive.

171
00:06:02,454 --> 00:06:04,484
赶紧的 我们下一站去哪
Come on! Where do we want to go next?

172
00:06:04,484 --> 00:06:06,724
伊森和我想去"幽灵公馆"里探险
Oh! Ethan and I want to try the haunted mansion.

173
00:06:06,880 --> 00:06:08,280
你可别趁机勾搭伊森
There is no you and Ethan.

174
00:06:08,284 --> 00:06:10,405
我们去丛林探险吧 就在那不远
Let's go to the jungle cruise. It's right there.

175
00:06:10,405 --> 00:06:12,105
咋了 厌倦了穿高跟鞋走远路吗
Why? Tired of walking in those heels?

176
00:06:12,180 --> 00:06:14,780
没 你会厌倦性感火辣的娇妻吗
No. You tired of being with a hot wife?

177
00:06:17,560 --> 00:06:18,880
哎呦 你瞅瞅 可真没料到
Well, well, well. What do you know?

178
00:06:18,880 --> 00:06:20,680
又一个负责任的家长在用儿童安全系绳
Another caring parent with a child safety tether.

179
00:06:21,060 --> 00:06:22,840
看 我们又不是唯一在用的
See? We're not the only people who use them.

180
00:06:22,840 --> 00:06:24,020
你家小孩真可爱
Hi! Aren't they adorable?

181
00:06:24,080 --> 00:06:25,360
瞧瞧你家小可爱
Oh, and look at your cutie!

182
00:06:25,487 --> 00:06:27,837
可不是嘛 她就想打个招呼
Oh, well, yes. She just wanted to say hi.

183
00:06:27,837 --> 00:06:29,467
不好意思 他俩今天有点小毛躁
Oh. Sorry. They're a little feisty today.

184
00:06:29,467 --> 00:06:31,017
没关系 她脾气挺好
Oh! No problem. She's friendly.

185
00:06:31,240 --> 00:06:32,280
雷克斯 礼貌点
Rex, gentle.

186
00:06:32,487 --> 00:06:34,228
他叫雷克斯[霸王龙] 对吧
Oh, his--his name's Rex, huh?

187
00:06:34,240 --> 00:06:34,620
是的
Yeah.

188
00:06:34,988 --> 00:06:36,918
那什么 莉莉 宝贝 莉莉...
Oh, okay. Lily, no, sweetie. Lily, um...

189
00:06:36,918 --> 00:06:38,638
抱歉 他就是有点人来疯
Oh. Sorry. He--he just gets excited.

190
00:06:38,638 --> 00:06:39,378
是啊 没关系
Oh, yeah, no--oh, no problem.

191
00:06:39,378 --> 00:06:40,779
莉莉 别跑了 亲爱的 停下来
Lily, stop moving, sweetie. Stop moving.

192
00:06:40,880 --> 00:06:41,800
好的 交给你了
Okay, you got this.

193
00:06:41,819 --> 00:06:44,549
好嘞 好嘞 乖女儿 乖女儿 抱歉
Okay. Okay. Good girl! Good girl! Sorry.

194
00:06:47,399 --> 00:06:49,450
想知道那次我为啥要和迪迪吵吗
You know what the fight with Dede was about?

195
00:06:49,450 --> 00:06:52,900
我录橄榄球比赛时洗掉了一集《达拉斯豪门恩怨》
I taped a football game over an episode of "Dallas."

196
00:06:53,300 --> 00:06:55,760
谁会就此撇下全家 拒绝一起去迪斯尼
Who bails on a family trip to Disneyland

197
00:06:55,760 --> 00:06:57,160
就为那么点鸡毛蒜皮的小事
over something like that?

198
00:06:57,460 --> 00:06:59,820
讽刺的是 达拉斯那场比赛还上场了
Ironically, Dallas was playing in the game.

199
00:06:59,820 --> 00:07:02,100
我当时还指给她看来着
And I remember pointing that out to her,

200
00:07:02,100 --> 00:07:03,040
再接着我就记得
and then I remember

201
00:07:03,040 --> 00:07:04,940
一盒录影带朝我脑门飞了过来
a video cassette flying at my head.

202
00:07:05,752 --> 00:07:06,842
你不是真的拉大提琴吧
You do not play the cello.

203
00:07:06,842 --> 00:07:08,792
是的 虽说有点怪咖 我不在乎
I do. Even geekier--I'm good.

204
00:07:08,820 --> 00:07:09,920
那好 回答我一个问题
Okay, answer me this--

205
00:07:09,960 --> 00:07:11,060
回答你十个问题都行
I will answer you this.

206
00:07:11,540 --> 00:07:13,400
为什么人们总是随身拖着大提琴
Why do people carry cellos around?

207
00:07:13,960 --> 00:07:16,000
也没见人拖着钢琴到处走啊
You know, people aren't expected to lug a piano around.

208
00:07:16,180 --> 00:07:16,860
原因不同在哪里
What's the cutoff?

209
00:07:16,940 --> 00:07:19,700
可不是嘛 大提琴 任我行
I know, right? Like, go where the cello is.

210
00:07:20,740 --> 00:07:23,400
瞧瞧他们 我无心插了一柳
Oh, look at this. I think I've inadvertently

211
00:07:23,400 --> 00:07:25,640
倒是给一14岁小萝莉和一大学男孩遮上了荫
set up my 14-year-old with a college boy.

212
00:07:25,740 --> 00:07:26,480
那男孩是你找来的
The boy was your doing?

213
00:07:26,480 --> 00:07:28,900
是啊 是啊 完美的男子
Yes. Yes, and he was perfect,

214
00:07:28,960 --> 00:07:30,920
海莉之前对他还是挺有好感的
and Haley was into him until,

215
00:07:30,960 --> 00:07:32,200
直到我们撞见了迪兰
of course, we ran into Dylan.

216
00:07:32,260 --> 00:07:34,480
说真的 怎么会有那么巧的事情
I mean, come on, dad. What are the odds of that happening?

217
00:07:34,520 --> 00:07:35,660
这世界小得很
It's a small world.

218
00:07:35,680 --> 00:07:36,200
可不是嘛
Yes, it is.

219
00:07:36,206 --> 00:07:36,886
-瞧见我刚刚的风采了吗 -我懂
- You see what I did there? - I did.

220
00:07:36,896 --> 00:07:38,536
-一把年纪疯狂玩 -我懂 我懂 老爸
- 'Cause it's a ride. - I got it. Got it, dad. I got it.

221
00:07:38,536 --> 00:07:40,506
真是让我太沮丧了...
It's so frustrating because...

222
00:07:40,716 --> 00:07:42,097
我知道我不能替海莉做主
I know I can't run Haley's life for her,

223
00:07:42,200 --> 00:07:45,260
不过如果她同意了 我肯定干得特别棒
but if she would let me, I would be so good at it.

224
00:07:45,277 --> 00:07:47,957
对啊 父母可是最会替孩子着想了
Right, 'cause parents always know what's best for their kids.

225
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:49,440
还记得我办公室里那个好女孩
You remember that nice girl at the office

226
00:07:49,440 --> 00:07:50,800
就是我打算介绍个米奇的那个吗
I tried to fix Mitch up with?

227
00:07:50,860 --> 00:07:53,480
无意冒犯 不过在理解孩子的"需求"方面
No offense, dad, but I think I probably have

228
00:07:53,480 --> 00:07:55,620
我的能力应该是比你更胜一筹的
a better sense of what my kids need than you did.

229
00:07:55,620 --> 00:07:57,400
你这么想可真是天真
I think it's cute you think that.

230
00:07:58,220 --> 00:07:58,720
老妈
Mom!

231
00:07:59,540 --> 00:08:00,960
玩得真是爽极了
It was so awesome!

232
00:08:01,420 --> 00:08:02,960
那车到处乱窜
The jeep was jerking around...

233
00:08:03,269 --> 00:08:05,700
那里到处是急转弯和大坡度
And--and there was a lot of sharp turns and big drops.

234
00:08:05,780 --> 00:08:06,660
它还继续往前开
It just kept going.

235
00:08:07,020 --> 00:08:08,120
你还好吗
Wow. You okay?

236
00:08:08,360 --> 00:08:09,920
好得很 怎么会不好
Great. Why wouldn't I be?

237
00:08:10,270 --> 00:08:11,500
因为我感觉你需要我的搀扶
Because you're kinda leaning on me.

238
00:08:11,640 --> 00:08:13,420
婚姻不就是要相互扶持吗
Well, isn't that what a marriage is?

239
00:08:13,531 --> 00:08:16,411
艾丽克斯 放开那个男孩
Ohh. Oh, Alex, stop touching him.

240
00:08:17,001 --> 00:08:18,351
你看上去糟透了
Oh. You look like hell.

241
00:08:18,511 --> 00:08:19,762
我晕头转向 满眼金星
I'm feeling a little dizzy.

242
00:08:20,100 --> 00:08:21,580
估计是刚才那一趟车给坐的
I think that ride did something to me.

243
00:08:21,712 --> 00:08:23,272
你内耳中的液体会变浓
The fluid in your inner ear is thickening.

244
00:08:23,380 --> 00:08:24,540
身体老化时就会这样
That's what happens when you get old.

245
00:08:24,540 --> 00:08:25,000
是吗
It is?

246
00:08:25,340 --> 00:08:26,720
某些动作你已经消受不起了
Yeah, you can't take the motion.

247
00:08:27,493 --> 00:08:29,793
我坐旋转椅之前都得先来颗"晕海宁"
I gotta pop a dramamine to get in my swivel chair.

248
00:08:29,820 --> 00:08:32,020
才不是那样 我可是过山车之王
That is not it. I'm king of the roller coasters.

249
00:08:33,000 --> 00:08:33,720
我觉得是因为
I think I just put

250
00:08:33,720 --> 00:08:35,740
早上我往烤饼里放太多生奶油了
too big of a whipped cream smile on my pancake this morning.

251
00:08:36,334 --> 00:08:37,574
你俩想去马特洪峰上看看吗
You guys wanna go on matterhorn?

252
00:08:37,574 --> 00:08:39,754
卢克 我和你爸还是坐这等你吧
Luke, I think me and your dad are gonna sit this one out,

253
00:08:39,754 --> 00:08:41,634
或许弄一大份腌黄瓜分着吃
maybe get one them big pickles.

254
00:08:41,634 --> 00:08:44,705
不 腌黄瓜你自己吃吧 杰
No! You're gonna have to eat that pickle on your own, Jay.

255
00:08:44,705 --> 00:08:46,805
我尚有几年年轻力壮的日子呢
I still got a few good years left.

256
00:08:46,805 --> 00:08:47,985
卢克 等等我
Luke, wait up!

257
00:08:47,985 --> 00:08:49,366
比比谁先到那
I'll race you there!

258
00:08:51,980 --> 00:08:53,360
我没事 我没事
I'm good. I'm good.

259
00:08:58,300 --> 00:08:59,740
每个人都在盯着咱
Okay, everybody's looking at us.

260
00:09:00,100 --> 00:09:01,420
我已经很久没被这么多人围观过了
I haven't been judged by this many people

261
00:09:01,420 --> 00:09:03,320
上次还是去全食市场忘带帆布包
since I forgot my canvas bags at whole foods.

262
00:09:03,380 --> 00:09:04,200
他们盯着我们可能是因为
Yeah, well, maybe they're staring

263
00:09:04,200 --> 00:09:05,420
对我们美好生活的羡慕嫉妒恨
because we have what they want.

264
00:09:05,517 --> 00:09:07,848
你是在说我们的"宠物闺女"吗
Whoa! Oh, a pet daughter. 'Cause that...

265
00:09:07,848 --> 00:09:09,398
旁人说什么我可不在乎
You know, I don't care what people think.

266
00:09:09,398 --> 00:09:10,758
只要我觉得可以保证我家闺女的安全
If I thought it would keep my daughter safe,

267
00:09:10,758 --> 00:09:13,018
让我在腹部缝一个袋鼠育儿袋我都愿意
I would have a kangaroo pouch sewn into my midriff.

268
00:09:13,018 --> 00:09:15,469
你身为单亲家长 这么一来是挺方便
That's gonna work out really well for you as a single parent.

269
00:09:15,700 --> 00:09:17,840
那"短袜凉脱"男诧异地看了我们一眼
Okay, we just got a glare from Mr. Socks-with-sandals.

270
00:09:17,880 --> 00:09:19,020
好了 我受够了
All right, that's it.

271
00:09:19,499 --> 00:09:21,110
莉莉 我来替你把这遛狗绳给解了
Lily, I'm gonna take off this leash.

272
00:09:21,110 --> 00:09:21,820
我觉得这样做是不对的
I think it's a mistake.

273
00:09:21,880 --> 00:09:23,180
但同时我也不希望你会乱跑
But I don't want you to run away,

274
00:09:23,190 --> 00:09:24,890
因为那样非常 非常危险
'cause that would be very, very unsafe,

275
00:09:24,890 --> 00:09:25,980
一旦我们找不着你
and if we lost you,

276
00:09:26,280 --> 00:09:28,980
你会惊恐万分 我们会悲痛欲绝 好吗
you'd be very scared, and we'd be very sad. Okay?

277
00:09:29,400 --> 00:09:29,880
好的
Okay.

278
00:09:30,080 --> 00:09:30,620
很好
All right.

279
00:09:30,760 --> 00:09:32,720
看 小卡 你若把她当个人对待
See, Cam? You treat her like a human being

280
00:09:32,720 --> 00:09:33,860
她就会以人的标准要求自己
and she acts like one.

281
00:09:34,631 --> 00:09:35,932
《奇奇与蒂蒂》
Chip 'n Dale!

282
00:09:35,960 --> 00:09:38,240
这下好了 她去追松鼠去了 莉莉
Oh, great. Now she's chasing squirrels. Lily!

283
00:09:38,580 --> 00:09:39,780
亲爱的 别跑
Honey, come on!

284
00:09:39,802 --> 00:09:41,612
莉莉 莉莉
Lily! Lily!

285
00:09:45,540 --> 00:09:47,500
"激流勇进"好玩吗
Hey! How was Splash Mountain?

286
00:09:47,560 --> 00:09:49,700
棒极了 要不我们再玩一次
It was great! Maybe we go again.

287
00:09:49,800 --> 00:09:51,820
我就免了 里面连手机信号都没有
No, thanks. There was no reception in there.

288
00:09:51,874 --> 00:09:54,794
知道刚刚我手机有几格信号吗 完全没有
You know how many bars I had? Zip-a-Dee-doo-dah.

289
00:09:55,304 --> 00:09:56,805
罗本 赶紧汇报
Reuben, talk to me!

290
00:09:57,100 --> 00:09:58,880
你要是脱了鞋休息一会儿肯定特舒坦
Must be nice to get out of those shoes for a minute.

291
00:09:59,545 --> 00:10:01,005
你这是在说什么呢
I don't know what you talking about.

292
00:10:01,020 --> 00:10:02,400
没啥 就随便唠唠
Nothing. I'm just making conversation.

293
00:10:03,800 --> 00:10:04,860
快来看看
Hey. Check it out.

294
00:10:04,920 --> 00:10:07,040
我这有张你们刚玩"激流勇进"时
I bought one of those souvenir photos

295
00:10:07,040 --> 00:10:08,340
你和曼尼拍下的纪念照
with you and Manny on the ride.

296
00:10:09,580 --> 00:10:11,420
老天 你刚才真是玩得挺爽
Boy, it looks like you're having a good time.

297
00:10:11,760 --> 00:10:13,780
等下 你手里拿的是什么啊
Wait a minute. What's that in your hand?

298
00:10:13,900 --> 00:10:15,100
是双高跟鞋吗
Are those shoes?

299
00:10:15,580 --> 00:10:17,320
这么模糊我都看不清是谁 杰
I'm not even sure that that is us, Jay.

300
00:10:17,360 --> 00:10:18,540
你为什么要忍着痛走路
Why are you walking around in pain?

301
00:10:18,900 --> 00:10:20,840
你就承认吧 穿这鞋来就不合适
Just admit the shoes were a bad idea.

302
00:10:21,040 --> 00:10:22,600
我可没感觉到痛
I am not in pain.

303
00:10:22,600 --> 00:10:26,600
我就是怕我最爱的鞋给弄湿了而已
I just didn't want my favorite walking shoes to get wet there.

304
00:10:26,880 --> 00:10:28,080
好吧 我错了
Okay, my bad.

305
00:10:28,238 --> 00:10:30,169
我们还得去"明日世界"和大家会合呢
Well, we've gotta meet everybody in Tomorrowland,

306
00:10:30,169 --> 00:10:31,219
所以赶紧走吧
so we'd better get movin'

307
00:10:31,219 --> 00:10:33,899
那地方可是在公园的另一边呢
'cause it's all the way on the other side of the park.

308
00:10:34,420 --> 00:10:35,380
我好得很
I'm fine.

309
00:10:35,580 --> 00:10:37,560
你可别让我们给甩下了
You just try to keep up with us.

310
00:10:39,140 --> 00:10:40,840
我看不下去了
I can't take this.

311
00:10:43,790 --> 00:10:46,181
爸 把手松开 太刺激了
Dad, throw your hands up! It's fun!

312
00:10:46,311 --> 00:10:47,721
是啊 真刺激
Oh, yeah, it is fun!

313
00:10:56,312 --> 00:10:59,022
罗本 如果你是在生日聚会上听说那股票的
Reuben, if you heard about that stock at a birthday party,

314
00:10:59,120 --> 00:11:00,120
那就已经晚了
it's already too late.

315
00:11:00,300 --> 00:11:00,740
歌洛莉亚
Gloria!

316
00:11:02,360 --> 00:11:03,680
歌洛莉亚 坐会儿
Gloria, sit down for a second.

317
00:11:03,800 --> 00:11:04,780
杰 我没事
I'm fine, Jay.

318
00:11:04,800 --> 00:11:05,180
求你了
Please?

319
00:11:07,000 --> 00:11:07,520
听我说
Look...

320
00:11:07,520 --> 00:11:08,900
你也许不痛苦
You may not be in pain...

321
00:11:08,964 --> 00:11:09,494
好吧
Okay.

322
00:11:09,494 --> 00:11:11,854
但只要觉得你痛苦 我就会痛苦
But I'm in pain just thinking you're in pain.

323
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:13,300
所以 你就乖乖听我一回
So humor me for one minute.

324
00:11:14,080 --> 00:11:14,920
这是什么
What are those?

325
00:11:15,540 --> 00:11:19,000
"灰姑娘"小店里没多少款式可供选择
There wasn't a big selection at the Bibbidi Bobbidi Boutique.

326
00:11:19,420 --> 00:11:20,340
你疯了吗
Are you crazy?

327
00:11:20,340 --> 00:11:24,460
我不能在大庭广众之下穿着...
I cannot walk around in public with these...

328
00:11:24,460 --> 00:11:27,080
这种东西走路 又黄有丑
Things. They're so yellow and so ugly.

329
00:11:27,126 --> 00:11:29,666
而且还很软
And... and they're so softy

330
00:11:29,700 --> 00:11:31,400
很舒服
and so comfortable.

331
00:11:31,640 --> 00:11:32,780
杰 这是什么
Jay, what is this?

332
00:11:34,100 --> 00:11:36,180
谢谢你给我买了这个
Thank you for going shopping for me.

333
00:11:36,240 --> 00:11:38,140
谢谢你心疼我的脚
Thank you for worrying about my feet.

334
00:11:38,720 --> 00:11:41,680
谢谢你在我冷的时候把外套给我穿
Thank you for giving me your jacket when I'm cold.

335
00:11:42,178 --> 00:11:43,778
杰 你真是个好男人
You're such a good man, Jay.

336
00:11:43,778 --> 00:11:45,239
谢谢
Thank you. Mmm.

337
00:11:49,000 --> 00:11:52,100
没想到你突然变得这么...
I didn't expect you to be so...

338
00:11:52,100 --> 00:11:52,660
温柔
So nice.

339
00:11:53,100 --> 00:11:54,580
你为何如此惊讶
Why are you so surprised?

340
00:11:55,960 --> 00:11:58,860
我说这话 你可别生气
Now please don't go all Latin on me when I say this.

341
00:11:59,860 --> 00:12:01,040
莫非
Is it possible

342
00:12:01,780 --> 00:12:03,760
你总发无名火的原因是
you get angry from time to time

343
00:12:04,800 --> 00:12:06,760
你脚下穿的一直是
because you're always wearing...

344
00:12:07,520 --> 00:12:08,560
让你搓火的鞋子
Uncomfortable shoes?

345
00:12:13,400 --> 00:12:13,960
可能吧
Maybe.

346
00:12:15,200 --> 00:12:17,320
能再给我买几双这样的鞋吗
Can you get me a couple of more?

347
00:12:17,543 --> 00:12:19,223
说不定有紫色的
Maybe they have purple?

348
00:12:19,540 --> 00:12:21,100
你想要啥都行 宝贝
Whatever you want, honey.

349
00:12:22,120 --> 00:12:23,380
我是说
All I'm saying is,

350
00:12:23,380 --> 00:12:24,940
你似乎很喜欢伊森
it seemed like you were pretty into Ethan

351
00:12:24,940 --> 00:12:26,280
直到迪兰出现
until Dylan showed up.

352
00:12:26,400 --> 00:12:28,960
别误会我 伊森人很好 但他不是迪兰
Don't get me wrong. Ethan's nice, but he's no Dylan.

353
00:12:29,200 --> 00:12:30,600
那不是好事吗
Maybe that's a good thing?

354
00:12:30,760 --> 00:12:32,800
为什么 就因为迪兰自由随性吗
Why? Because Dylan's a free spirit?

355
00:12:33,000 --> 00:12:34,160
是因为他太前卫了吗
He's too edgy for you?

356
00:12:34,160 --> 00:12:35,480
还是因为他的特立独行
He plays by his own rules?

357
00:12:36,200 --> 00:12:37,240
天呐
Oh, my God.

358
00:12:37,380 --> 00:12:37,780
怎么了
What?

359
00:12:38,540 --> 00:12:40,560
我想请你转身
I beg of you to turn around

360
00:12:40,560 --> 00:12:43,600
和我一同见证我此生最难忘的一幕
and experience with me the greatest moment of my life.

361
00:12:48,360 --> 00:12:50,820
你的叛逆男友变成了四重奏歌手
Your rebel boyfriend's a Dapper Dan.

362
00:12:51,220 --> 00:12:52,180
也许我们看错了
Maybe that's not him.

363
00:12:57,680 --> 00:12:58,260
迪兰
Dylan!

364
00:12:58,318 --> 00:13:00,078
对不起
Uh, uh, sorry.

365
00:13:00,368 --> 00:13:00,958
对不起
Sorry. Um...

366
00:13:00,958 --> 00:13:02,939
确实很像他
It certainly seems like him.

367
00:13:05,560 --> 00:13:06,660
天呐 他看起来
Oh, my God. He looked like

368
00:13:06,660 --> 00:13:08,660
像老爸高中时的旧照片
those old pictures of dad from high school.

369
00:13:10,210 --> 00:13:11,440
反正 我最近爱上街头艺术了
So anyway, I've really been into street art lately.

370
00:13:11,440 --> 00:13:13,570
城里有个展览很不错 我带你去吧
Oh, there's a really great exhibit downtown. I'll take you.

371
00:13:13,840 --> 00:13:15,380
怎么去 用你那"劲爆"踏板车去吗
Oh, on what, your razor scooter?

372
00:13:15,660 --> 00:13:16,260
老妈找你
Mom wants you.

373
00:13:16,260 --> 00:13:16,890
我 我 我
I-I-I...

374
00:13:17,060 --> 00:13:19,680
伊森 我到处找你呢
Ethan! I've been looking all over for you!

375
00:13:23,400 --> 00:13:25,860
我记得当时是在玩"加勒比海盗"
I remember I was on Pirates of the Caribbean,

376
00:13:26,512 --> 00:13:29,102
跟迪迪吵得那一架真是太闹心了
and this whole fight with Dede was really eating at me.

377
00:13:29,260 --> 00:13:32,040
游乐项目中有个疯婆娘
And there was this angry animatronic wench

378
00:13:32,040 --> 00:13:34,440
拿着擀面杖 追着个可怜的海盗
with a rolling pin, chasing some poor pirate around.

379
00:13:34,600 --> 00:13:37,120
他俩绕着一个圆环不停转圈
They were on a track, running in circles,

380
00:13:37,120 --> 00:13:38,740
也就是说他永远摆脱不了她
so he could never get away from her.

381
00:13:39,320 --> 00:13:40,800
我当时就在想
And I remember thinking,

382
00:13:41,300 --> 00:13:42,620
哥们 我是救不了你
I can't save you, buddy,

383
00:13:43,740 --> 00:13:45,280
但我要结束我自己的婚姻之旅
but I'm getting off this ride.

384
00:13:46,534 --> 00:13:48,345
然后 然后我们正要拐弯
...and--and we were going around a corner,

385
00:13:48,345 --> 00:13:50,865
我尖叫了 吃进了一只虫子
and I was screaming and I swallowed a bug.

386
00:13:50,865 --> 00:13:53,605
我最喜欢坐最后一节车厢了
Oh, being tail is everything that I dreamed it would be.

387
00:13:53,680 --> 00:13:54,600
接下来该干啥呢
What should we do next?

388
00:13:54,700 --> 00:13:55,220
坐下
Sit down.

389
00:13:55,705 --> 00:13:56,386
我们坐哪儿
Where we gonna sit down?

390
00:13:56,386 --> 00:13:59,636
坐地上就这儿 坐这儿就好
The ground. Here, this is good right here. Oh!

391
00:13:59,636 --> 00:14:00,466
爸 你没事吧
Are you okay, dad?

392
00:14:00,660 --> 00:14:02,000
我不行了
No, I'm not okay.

393
00:14:03,166 --> 00:14:03,767
虽然我不想承认
I hate to tell you this,

394
00:14:03,980 --> 00:14:05,380
可这一趟趟车坐的我命都快没了
but these rides are killing me.

395
00:14:05,877 --> 00:14:07,597
你可是过山车之王啊
B-but you're the king of roller coasters.

396
00:14:07,597 --> 00:14:08,718
我知道
I know!

397
00:14:09,120 --> 00:14:10,740
岁月不饶人啊
Something happens when you get older.

398
00:14:11,608 --> 00:14:13,318
身体已经吃不消了
Guess you can't take it.

399
00:14:14,380 --> 00:14:15,840
我这辈子最喜欢干的事儿
One of my favorite things in the world

400
00:14:15,840 --> 00:14:17,780
就是和你一起做傻事
is doing stupid fun stuff with you,

401
00:14:18,538 --> 00:14:19,859
比如踩着跳跳鼠打篮球
like pogo stick basketball

402
00:14:19,859 --> 00:14:21,889
以及试图把秋千荡一整个圈
or trying to get a swing to go all the way around.

403
00:14:21,889 --> 00:14:24,219
下一次咱试试坐在灭火器上
Next time, we should sit on a fire extinguisher.

404
00:14:24,320 --> 00:14:26,360
好 或者是可乐加薄荷糖
Yes, or a bottle of coke and some mentos.

405
00:14:27,460 --> 00:14:29,870
不过说实话 我现在的感受是
Honestly, though, the way I'm feeling right now,

406
00:14:29,870 --> 00:14:31,990
不知道自己还能不能活到那时候
I don't know if there's gonna be a next time.

407
00:14:32,140 --> 00:14:35,260
爸 我们总能找到好玩的事儿干
Dad, we can always find cool stuff to do.

408
00:14:35,780 --> 00:14:37,760
哪怕你老了 坐在轮椅里
Even if you're old and in a wheelchair,

409
00:14:38,281 --> 00:14:39,261
我会带你到商场
I'll take you to the mall

410
00:14:39,261 --> 00:14:40,951
你想飞多快 我就推多快
and push you as fast as you wanna go.

411
00:14:41,120 --> 00:14:41,460
真的吗
Really?

412
00:14:42,560 --> 00:14:43,240
你会那么做吗
You'd do that?

413
00:14:43,600 --> 00:14:44,320
必须的
Heck, yeah.

414
00:14:44,672 --> 00:14:46,042
再试试玩轮椅特技
And we'll pop some wheelies, too.

415
00:14:46,120 --> 00:14:46,920
听起来不错哦
That sounds fun.

416
00:14:46,980 --> 00:14:49,640
我还会把你推到山顶上 然后放手
And I'll take you to the top of a huge hill and just let go.

417
00:14:49,663 --> 00:14:51,663
好吧 细节我们以后好商量
Okay, we'll nail down the specifics later,

418
00:14:51,663 --> 00:14:54,243
不过听起来真棒
but that... That's really nice.

419
00:14:55,633 --> 00:14:57,194
你还想接着聊吗
So do you still wanna talk or--

420
00:14:57,194 --> 00:14:59,584
不聊了 去玩"飞跃太空山"吧
No, go. Ride Space Mountain.

421
00:15:00,664 --> 00:15:01,914
最后他们照相时
Uh, at the end, when they take a picture,

422
00:15:01,960 --> 00:15:03,480
做搞怪的动作吧 算我一个
do something hilarious for both of us.

423
00:15:03,494 --> 00:15:04,876
那会要了你的命的
You're gonna die.

424
00:15:05,435 --> 00:15:07,975
我是说你看到会笑死的 不是说你太老了
When you see it, not 'cause you're old.

425
00:15:10,420 --> 00:15:12,360
莉莉 莉莉 别跑
Lily! Lily, stop!

426
00:15:12,446 --> 00:15:13,566
爸爸 爸爸 抓住她
Dad! Dad, grab her!

427
00:15:13,566 --> 00:15:15,496
抓住你了 你这小猴子
Hey, I gotcha, you little monkey!

428
00:15:15,620 --> 00:15:16,180
谢谢
Thank you.

429
00:15:16,556 --> 00:15:17,846
嘿 小卡 我逮住她了
Hey, Cam, I got her.

430
00:15:17,846 --> 00:15:19,666
我们在"幻想世界" 你们在哪儿
We're in Fantasyland. Where are you?

431
00:15:20,607 --> 00:15:21,627
好吧 那是叫"卡通城"
Okay, it's toontown,

432
00:15:21,640 --> 00:15:22,240
不是"卡咚城"
not toonton.

433
00:15:22,340 --> 00:15:23,500
你看太多PBS电视台的剧了
You've been watching too much PBS.

434
00:15:24,180 --> 00:15:24,940
谢谢
Thank you.

435
00:15:25,060 --> 00:15:26,100
好吧 宝贝 过来
All right, honey, come here.

436
00:15:27,760 --> 00:15:29,200
我不喜欢这东西
I don't like this thing.

437
00:15:29,280 --> 00:15:29,720
是嘛
Yeah?

438
00:15:29,720 --> 00:15:31,380
我还不想像个疯子一样
Well, I don't like running like a crazy person

439
00:15:31,388 --> 00:15:33,068
在《唐顿迪斯尼庄园》跑来跑去呢
through Downton Disney--

440
00:15:33,068 --> 00:15:34,259
"迪斯尼市镇"
Downtown Disney.

441
00:15:35,158 --> 00:15:35,939
我不知道做什么好
I don't know what to do.

442
00:15:35,939 --> 00:15:38,059
遛狗绳既然行不通 让我给你指条明路
Well, the leash is not the answer. You want my help?

443
00:15:38,059 --> 00:15:38,859
快帮帮我吧
Yes, please!

444
00:15:38,859 --> 00:15:40,989
给我两分钟 我就能帮你搞定
'Cause I can fix this for you in about two minutes.

445
00:15:41,140 --> 00:15:42,560
来吧 小姑娘 跟我走
Come on, baby girl. Come with me.

446
00:15:42,820 --> 00:15:43,660
我们马上就回来
We'll be right back.

447
00:15:44,200 --> 00:15:44,560
好的
Okay.

448
00:15:45,000 --> 00:15:46,760
我们要去哪儿 这边吗
Where we going? Oh, this way?

449
00:15:50,760 --> 00:15:52,360
曼尼 你这张苦逼脸不像是来
Manny, you don't sound very happy

450
00:15:52,360 --> 00:15:53,880
开开心心坐"小飞象"的孩子啊
for a kid that is flying an elephant.

451
00:15:54,941 --> 00:15:57,261
我输给德卡斯了 这不公平
I lost to Durkas. It's not fair.

452
00:15:57,261 --> 00:15:59,932
他想买下IBM 因为他觉得这听起来很有趣
He wanted to buy IBM because he thought it was funny to say.

453
00:16:00,040 --> 00:16:01,540
好吧 我很高兴你输了
Well, I'm glad that you lost.

454
00:16:01,742 --> 00:16:03,482
模拟经营游戏让你变了
Fake money has changed you.

455
00:16:03,482 --> 00:16:07,083
从前那个会停下来赏花的曼尼去哪儿了
Where is the Manny that used to stop to smell the roses?

456
00:16:07,083 --> 00:16:09,513
他搬到圣何塞 洗上太阳能热水澡了呢
He took a bath on a solar start-up in San Jose.

457
00:16:09,513 --> 00:16:12,723
你一整天都电话不离手
You have been so busy burying your face in your phone

458
00:16:12,800 --> 00:16:14,920
跟家人连个招呼都不打
that you barely said hello to your family,

459
00:16:14,974 --> 00:16:17,744
对维尼熊也是爱理不理
you gave Winnie the Pooh the cold shoulder,

460
00:16:17,744 --> 00:16:18,774
甚至都没注意到
and you haven't even noticed

461
00:16:18,920 --> 00:16:21,200
那边蓝色小象里的小美女
that pretty girl in the blue elephant

462
00:16:21,200 --> 00:16:23,080
一直冲着你笑呢
that has been smiling at you.

463
00:16:24,755 --> 00:16:27,065
虽说不是我的型 但被人欣赏终究不错
Not my type, but still it's nice to be noticed.

464
00:16:27,065 --> 00:16:28,015
瞧见没
You see what happens

465
00:16:28,015 --> 00:16:30,396
你醉心生意错过了多少幸福时光
when you're not burying your head in business?

466
00:16:30,560 --> 00:16:32,160
你说的对 我尽量享受当下吧
You're right. I'll try to be more present.

467
00:16:35,460 --> 00:16:36,720
你脚上是什么东西
What the heck's on your feet?

468
00:16:37,620 --> 00:16:39,720
拖鞋 软得和枕头一样
They're slippers! They're like pillows.

469
00:16:42,877 --> 00:16:44,148
小乖乖
Attagirl.

470
00:16:45,140 --> 00:16:45,940
不用谢我
You're welcome.

471
00:16:46,628 --> 00:16:48,288
看 你爸给他孙女买了高跟鞋
Look. Your dad got her baby high heels,

472
00:16:48,288 --> 00:16:50,178
咱不是说过绝不让她穿吗
which we said we were never gonna let her wear.

473
00:16:50,178 --> 00:16:50,868
我喜欢这鞋
I love 'em.

474
00:16:51,060 --> 00:16:52,340
你看起来真漂亮 宝贝
You look gorgeous, sweetie.

475
00:16:52,469 --> 00:16:54,049
老天 想想刚才旁人对咱的嫌弃劲儿
Oh, my gosh. You felt people judged us before?

476
00:16:54,049 --> 00:16:55,369
现在却是阿纳海姆选美小冠军
Wait till they meet little Miss Anaheim.

477
00:16:55,369 --> 00:16:57,799
那倒还好 不过她是走都走不利索了
Who cares? Look at her. She can barely move.

478
00:16:58,220 --> 00:16:59,100
多谢了 老爸
Thank you, dad.

479
00:17:00,550 --> 00:17:04,130
知道吗 三岁的女娃就有这美腿 真难得
You know what? She's got pretty good gams for a 3-year-old.

480
00:17:06,180 --> 00:17:06,620
茄子
Cheese!

481
00:17:07,840 --> 00:17:09,480
好了 谢谢 约翰熊
Got it. Thanks, little John.

482
00:17:09,580 --> 00:17:10,680
谢谢
Thank you!

483
00:17:12,321 --> 00:17:13,591
那边有卖玉米热狗的
Ooh, they have corn dogs.

484
00:17:13,591 --> 00:17:15,512
回家前一定得吃一个 绝世美味
We gotta get one before we go back. They are legendary.

485
00:17:15,512 --> 00:17:16,112
我马上回来
I'll be right back.

486
00:17:16,112 --> 00:17:17,173
好的
Okay.

487
00:17:17,902 --> 00:17:18,943
海莉
Haley!

488
00:17:19,180 --> 00:17:20,660
是我 迪兰
It's me. Dylan.

489
00:17:21,120 --> 00:17:23,940
我穿着熊戏服 专门借来好跟你说话
I'm in the bear suit. I borrowed it to talk to you.

490
00:17:24,180 --> 00:17:25,760
你为什么要这样跳舞
Why are you dancing like that?

491
00:17:26,100 --> 00:17:28,220
约翰熊就是这样跳的 可能吧
This is what little John does. Maybe.

492
00:17:28,360 --> 00:17:29,900
我不知道这货出自哪部电影
I don't know what movie this dude is from.

493
00:17:30,020 --> 00:17:31,740
我根本不应该跟你讲话的
I'm not even supposed to be talking to you.

494
00:17:31,940 --> 00:17:33,320
我也不想跟你说
Well, I'm not talking to you.

495
00:17:33,500 --> 00:17:35,220
不 你可以说话
No, you can talk.

496
00:17:35,840 --> 00:17:37,700
我知道 可我气得说不出
I know, but I'm mad.

497
00:17:38,000 --> 00:17:40,000
你回到家都不给我打个电话
You came back to town and didn't even call me.

498
00:17:40,100 --> 00:17:41,280
我觉得太丢人了
I was embarrassed.

499
00:17:41,900 --> 00:17:43,740
我丢掉了度假牧场的工作
I lost my job at the dude ranch,

500
00:17:43,740 --> 00:17:45,780
我得先理清头绪
and I wanted to get my act together first.

501
00:17:45,856 --> 00:17:47,966
四傻蛋骑单车有用吗
But the four dweebs on a bike act?

502
00:17:47,966 --> 00:17:50,276
四重唱可是街头表演的老传统
Hey, the dapper dans are a main street tradition

503
00:17:50,400 --> 00:17:51,900
1959年就开始了
since 1959.

504
00:17:52,760 --> 00:17:53,740
这是怎么回事
Hey, what's going on?

505
00:17:55,160 --> 00:17:55,680
没什么
Nothing.

506
00:17:56,220 --> 00:17:57,520
我还爱着她 伊森
I still love her, Ethan.

507
00:17:58,627 --> 00:17:59,807
你怎么知道我的名字
Okay, how do you know my name?

508
00:17:59,960 --> 00:18:00,600
我是迪兰
It's Dylan.

509
00:18:00,718 --> 00:18:03,638
我今天不是故意来给你添堵
Look, I don't wanna harsh your day,

510
00:18:03,698 --> 00:18:07,368
但我一直爱着海莉 而且会爱到地老天荒
but I never stopped loving Haley and I never will!

511
00:18:07,448 --> 00:18:08,689
你这是在演滑稽戏呢
I-is this some sort of joke?

512
00:18:08,900 --> 00:18:10,200
我看起来很滑稽吗
Do I look like I'm joking?

513
00:18:10,380 --> 00:18:11,780
迪兰 现在别这样
Dylan, let's not do this now.

514
00:18:11,799 --> 00:18:15,139
就得现在 我三点还得参加游行
It has to be now. I've got a parade at 3:00.

515
00:18:15,139 --> 00:18:16,520
说真的哥们 边儿呆着去
Hey, seriously, dude, back off.

516
00:18:16,600 --> 00:18:18,920
首先 这可是我的脸
Okay, that was my face.

517
00:18:19,360 --> 00:18:22,620
再者 该一边凉快的人是你
And you're the one who needs to back off.

518
00:18:25,600 --> 00:18:25,800
你...
You...

519
00:18:26,261 --> 00:18:28,951
好吧 这套衣服还挺重的
Okay. This thing's kinda heavy.

520
00:18:28,960 --> 00:18:29,840
我起不来了
I can't get up.

521
00:18:30,100 --> 00:18:32,540
伊森 伊森 怎么啦 你在做什么
Ethan? Ethan, what is going on? What are you doing?

522
00:18:33,022 --> 00:18:34,492
你好 邓菲太太
Uh, hi, Mrs. Dunphy.

523
00:18:34,492 --> 00:18:35,643
搭把手
Help me up.

524
00:18:36,240 --> 00:18:36,660
不
No.

525
00:18:39,543 --> 00:18:41,303
可别让我起来 要不我一定...
If I could get up, I would--uhh!

526
00:18:43,760 --> 00:18:45,920
快点 莉莉宝贝 跟上 亲爱的
Come on, Lily sweetie. Keep up, honey.

527
00:18:46,554 --> 00:18:49,644
-快点 -菲尔 你看起来没什么精神啊
- Come on. - Phil, you don't look like you're doing very well.

528
00:18:49,660 --> 00:18:51,600
可能是因为刚才在雷鸣山我正式
Maybe because I officially became an old man

529
00:18:51,600 --> 00:18:52,680
体会到了这身老骨头的脆弱
back there at thunder mountain.

530
00:18:53,180 --> 00:18:55,960
我的天 你好烫啊
Oh, my goodness. You are burning up.

531
00:18:56,060 --> 00:18:57,020
你可能是得流感了
You might have the flu.

532
00:18:58,940 --> 00:19:00,720
我有几个同事得流感了
A bunch of guys at work had the flu,

533
00:19:00,720 --> 00:19:03,020
我们共享一盒橙汁来着
and we all drink orange juice out of the same carton.

534
00:19:03,846 --> 00:19:05,136
应该用杯子的
We should get cups.

535
00:19:05,760 --> 00:19:08,000
卢克 听到了吗 是因为我得流感了
Luke, did you hear that?! I have the flu!

536
00:19:08,680 --> 00:19:10,240
幸好我们没有共享那根腌黄瓜
Glad we didn't share that pickle.

537
00:19:10,720 --> 00:19:11,520
大家好
Hey, everybody.

538
00:19:12,960 --> 00:19:14,680
大家伙儿 伊森呢
Oh, hey, hey, guys. Where's Ethan?

539
00:19:14,780 --> 00:19:16,620
他还在 去找他朋友去了
Oh, he's staying. He ran into some friends.

540
00:19:16,720 --> 00:19:18,040
但迪兰被炒掉了 所以...
But Dylan got fired, so...

541
00:19:18,040 --> 00:19:20,960
先别抓狂 不过我们得把迪兰捎回家
Don't freak out. We have to give him a ride home.

542
00:19:21,560 --> 00:19:22,660
还有我们破镜重圆了
And we're back together.

543
00:19:25,020 --> 00:19:27,620
没看林肯前 谁都别想走
Hey, no one goes home till we hit the Lincoln thing.

544
00:19:28,219 --> 00:19:29,009
无聊
Yawn.

545
00:19:29,009 --> 00:19:30,799
别做徒劳的反抗
Don't even try to fight it.

546
00:19:30,940 --> 00:19:32,340
我们小时候 他就逼我们看
Yeah, he made us go when we were kids.

547
00:19:32,380 --> 00:19:34,760
来吧各位 那可是机器人总统
Come on, people! It's a robotic president!

548
00:19:34,880 --> 00:19:36,080
爱还来不及
What's not to love?

549
00:19:36,640 --> 00:19:37,930
机器人总统
A robotic president?

550
00:19:38,060 --> 00:19:40,920
我原计划是 带克莱尔和米奇尔回家
So my plan was, drive Claire and Mitchell home,

551
00:19:40,920 --> 00:19:42,300
哄他们睡觉后
put them to bed,

552
00:19:42,620 --> 00:19:44,620
给自己倒上一大杯威士忌
pour myself a big tumbler of scotch,

553
00:19:45,711 --> 00:19:47,371
然后跟迪迪说离婚
and tell Dede it was over.

554
00:19:47,400 --> 00:19:49,400
但在回家前 我们又去了一处地方
But on the way out, we made one last stop.

555
00:19:50,420 --> 00:19:52,180
如果我们注定要灭亡
If destruction be our lot,

556
00:19:53,722 --> 00:19:55,583
只有自己
we are ourselves

557
00:19:55,583 --> 00:19:58,843
是自己的掘墓人
must be its author and finisher.

558
00:19:58,860 --> 00:20:01,080
在自由人民组成的国家里
As a nation of free men,

559
00:20:01,860 --> 00:20:04,240
我们必须经历过种种...
we must live through all times...

560
00:20:04,740 --> 00:20:05,920
我不知道怎么回事
I don't know what happened.

561
00:20:05,960 --> 00:20:08,440
可能是机器人林肯说到了男人的责任
Maybe it's what robot Lincoln said about a man's duty

562
00:20:08,440 --> 00:20:10,560
或者要紧密"结合"在一起
or keeping the union together.

563
00:20:11,420 --> 00:20:13,320
也可能就是我怂了
Maybe I just chickened out.

564
00:20:14,020 --> 00:20:16,060
但我意识到和我的孩子们在一起
But I realized that staying with my kids

565
00:20:16,060 --> 00:20:18,340
比离开妻子重要得多
was more important than leaving my wife.

566
00:20:19,440 --> 00:20:21,200
这样的选择并非适合所有人
Now that's not the right decision for everyone,

567
00:20:21,200 --> 00:20:23,820
但对我来说是绝对明智的
but it was the right decision for me.

568
00:20:24,320 --> 00:20:26,280
凭着这信心
And in that faith,

569
00:20:26,940 --> 00:20:28,440
让我们至终
let us, to the end,

570
00:20:29,000 --> 00:20:30,560
能够恪尽职责
dare to do our duty

571
00:20:31,520 --> 00:20:33,460
像我们心中理解的那样
as we understand it.

572
00:20:33,580 --> 00:20:35,240
于是我坚持到了孩子们长大成人
So I stuck it out until they were grown...

573
00:20:35,978 --> 00:20:39,018
杰 要不要一起洗个鸳鸯浴
Jay, you want to join me in the jacuzzi?

574
00:20:39,420 --> 00:20:41,240
苍天有眼 苦尽甘来
And the universe rewarded me.

575
00:20:46,109 --> 00:20:47,439
开始咯
Here we go!

576
00:20:47,439 --> 00:20:49,350
爸 来个过山车拳拳碰
Hey, dad, roller coast fist bump.

577
00:20:59,771 --> 00:21:00,912
什么情况
What was that?

578
00:21:04,932 --> 00:21:06,622
肯定酷毙了
Is this gonna be so awesome!

579
00:21:11,683 --> 00:21:13,863
闭上眼睛 感觉更爽
Close your eyes. It make it more fun.

580
00:21:14,053 --> 00:21:15,783
是啊 的确更爽
Oh, yeah. That is more fun.
